Package: RClinVarbitration
Type: Package
Title: Build Tidy ClinVar Evidence and Arbitration Tables
Version: 0.1.1.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Sounkou Mahamane", family = "Toure",
           email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(given = "DuckDB Foundation", role = "cph",
           comment = "Bundled DuckDB C extension headers"),
    person(given = "Centre for Population Genomics", role = "cph",
           comment = "ClinVarbitration 2.2.11 decision-policy semantics")
    )
Description: Joins official 'ClinVar' variant and submission reports directly
    into one tidy scalar 'DuckDB' table containing variations, alleles,
    GRCh37/GRCh38 locations, decisions, source assertions, and gene links.
    ClinVarbitration policy is implemented in SQL over those reports. An
    optional package-owned native extension streams VCV XML into the same
    table when richer observations, conditions, citations, attributes, and
    attributable evidence text are required, and streams PubMed baseline or
    update XML into scalar PMID-authoritative literature relations.
